OL,3,AGatwick Airport facing water outage
OL,4,Aafter main burst
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe issues come after a major supply
OL,7,Foutage in July saw passengers face long
OL,8,Fqueues for toilets at the West Sussex
OL,9,Fairport, with restaurants and bars also
OL,10,Fclosing.
